{
  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/dam.json \u2014 RoomSpec for De Dam (the city, district 4: the Dam): the Dam: the Royal Palace along its west side, the Nieuwe Kerk at its north-west corner, the National Monument on the east, the department store on the north by the way into Damrak. The November funfair was up when it happened, and the army made the square the evacuation point around it: the Ferris wheel and the rides still lit and stopped, buses lined up with their doors open, army trucks, a field hospital, and the luggage of thousands left where the queues were. Modelled after openly licensed photographs; every business name is made up, the landmarks keep theirs. The power is still on; nobody is there. Outdoor (street.py, city.py and landmarks.py build it). Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
